## Description

I noticed that the images are not being properly pushed to the `rstudio/r-base` repo with the changes I made adding the `posit/r-base` as the `BASE_IMAGE`. I removed what I added before because it felt messy and instead added the repo/org secrets as part of the GHA build matrix. This should ensure each image is being built and tagged properly, and then authenticating and pushing to the correct repo.

